    "type": "h2",
    "children": [
      {
        "text": "9.3.4 正确基线：进程内 RLock 表达的原子边界"
      }
    ],
    "id": "RYlfATECTh"
  },
  {
    "type": "p",
    "children": [
      {
        "text": "在引入任何错误补丁之前，项目必须处于一个\"正确基线\"状态：全部不变量测试通过，Ruff 与 mypy 等确定性检查干净。正确基线的关键设计在于"
      },
      {
        "text": "用进程内 RLock 显式表达\"检查与更新必须原子化\"",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": "，例如："
      }
    ],
    "id": "cP9_BUCOtq"
  },
  {
    "children": [
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "# 教学简化示例：表达\"检查与更新原子化\"的锁边界"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "wvdF6KA4Ic"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "# 这不是生产数据库实现，仅用于在本实验环境中定义正确行为"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "zGjenxqltv"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "from threading import RLock"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "gXzm625U-a"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": ""
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "zn01-vGA5S"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "class BalanceRepository:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "ImjXhXtcs4"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "    def __init__(self) -> None:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "pryg3zr8H3"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "        self._lock = RLock()"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "rHKVm4mxCo"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "        self._balances: dict[str, int] = {}"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "9A2kGouKLT"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": ""
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "k_Lg-aMzSt"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "    def atomic_transfer(self, source: str, target: str, amount: int) -> None:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "GGX7zouss0"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "        with self._lock:                     # 锁边界 == 原子边界"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "H6Aebm_Awm"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "            if self._balances.get(source, 0) < amount:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "Uy6TYbK-lU"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "                raise InsufficientBalance()"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "CN-VaSU8q3"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "            self._balances[source] = self._balances.get(source, 0) - amount"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "z_mj9h7YLm"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "text": "            self._balances[target] = self._balances.get(target, 0) + amount"
          }
        ],
        "type": "code_line",
        "id": "Wa8xBqL6UF"
      }
    ],
    "type": "code_block",
    "lang": "python",
    "id": "zIubTmWgZs"
  },
  {
    "type": "p",
    "children": [
      {
        "text": "这个示例要表达的不是锁 API 本身，而是"
      },
      {
        "text": "一条可验证的原子性纪律：余额读取、余额判断与余额更新必须处于同一原子边界内",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": "。PR-04 的错误补丁正是把余额检查移到了这个边界之外（见 9.7），从而导致两个线程同时读到旧余额。"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UzCdB2Wm3T"
  },
  {
    "type": "p",
    "children": [
      {
        "text": "必须同时声明这里的边界："
      },
      {
        "text": "进程内 RLock 证明的是单进程实验环境里的不变量，不是生产分布式资金系统的正确性",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": "。生产数据库可能需要行锁、可串行化事务，或者带版本号和重试的 CAS（Compare-And-Swap）。本书中的修复证明的是\"实验不变量恢复\"，不能直接复制到分布式资金系统——这条边界在 9.7 与 9.12 会反复出现，请读者始终保持区分。"
      }
    ],
    "id": "lSnD4arZPH"
  },
  {
    "type": "h2",
    "children": [
      {
        "text": "9.3.5 Oracle：人工确认的正确答案"
